あけない夜なんてない 光のドレス纏って
There's no night that won't end, dressed in a gown of light,

91
00:23:38,066 --> 00:23:43,566
手をつなぎ合い 笑い合いたいから 綺麗になってだって
because I want to hold hands and laugh together, becoming even more beautiful,

92
00:23:43,866 --> 00:23:48,566
きっと自分自身持って 上から目線だって
surely holding onto yourself, even with a high-and-mighty gaze,

93
00:23:48,866 --> 00:23:53,566
ここでぶつかりたいの いつもよりもちょっと
I want to collide here, a little more than always,

94
00:23:53,866 --> 00:23:58,566
大きな声でもっと 揺れて
with a bigger voice, shaking even more,

95
00:23:58,866 --> 00:24:04,566
ずっとしてほしかったんだよね 声がちょっとちっちゃいかも
you wanted me to keep doing this all along, right? Though my voice might be a little small,

96
00:24:13,066 --> 00:24:18,066
スポットライトもちょっと あてて聞いて頂戴
please shine the spotlight a little more and listen!

97
00:24:18,866 --> 00:24:23,566
不安も全部巻き込んで 上がるステージで
wrapping up all our anxiety, on the rising stage,

98
00:24:23,866 --> 00:24:28,566
星の光にだって これが私のロックロール
even in starlight, this is my rock 'n' roll,

99
00:24:28,866 --> 00:24:33,566
君だけにみせたい 答えのセカイ
the world of answers I want to show only to you,

100
00:24:35,866 --> 00:24:41,566
みんなこの世界で 一緒に踊ろうよ
let's all dance together in this world!

101
00:24:42,066 --> 00:24:44,566
セイ・ホー！
Say ho!

102
00:25:01,471 --> 00:25:04,871
そんじゃねって なって だって 未来を見に行こうよ
Saying "see you later"... Come on, let's go see the future together!

103
00:25:04,871 --> 00:25:08,071
偶然の風に吹かれて 綺麗になってだって
Caught in a chance breeze, growing prettier...

104
00:25:08,071 --> 00:25:12,071
すれ違う自信持って ねだろだって いいよ
Holding onto passing confidence, let's ask for it, sure, that's fine!

105
00:25:12,071 --> 00:25:16,771
君と一緒に歌いたいんだよ いつもよりも風よりも覚悟して
I want to sing together with you, more than always, more than the wind, with determination!

106
00:25:16,771 --> 00:25:19,871
きっといつの日か
Surely one day...

107
00:25:19,871 --> 00:25:23,971
最高の笑顔が咲くよ
The ultimate smile will bloom!

108
00:25:23,971 --> 00:25:28,371
大きくだって だって 君に届けたいよ
Even bigger, bigger, I want to deliver it to you!

109
